    "All 68 other reviewed measurement sources and all 21 dependency source inputs remain byte-identical.",
    "The only caller delta adds explicit lifetime-required warm argument admission and distinct unique witness identities.",
    "The included warm workload, input fixtures, output checks, timed intervals, counters, hooks and destructor behavior remain unchanged.",
